               PERFORM VALIDATE-HOUSE-TYPE-0001.
               PERFORM DERIVE-MAKE-0002.
               PERFORM SQL-ACCESS-0003.
               PERFORM APPLY-CC-RATING-0005.
               PERFORM SQL-ACCESS-0006.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
