       CALL-ZCL01EY1-001.
               MOVE 'ZCL01EY1' TO WS-SUBNAME-7
               CALL WS-SUBNAME-7 USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZCL01EY1 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
